# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large media, deliberately kept out of the repo
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# The untouched camera/export originals. 2.6GB, and eight of them are
# over GitHub's hard 100MB per-file limit, so they cannot be pushed at
# all. These are the source copies — keep them backed up off-git.
Media Masters/

# The compressed web previews the site plays. 880MB: it would push, but
# it would put the repo near GitHub's 1GB soft limit and make every
# clone enormous. Host these on object storage/CDN and point the site at
# them. The art masters in art-masters/ *are* tracked — they're 54MB.
public/video/

# Claude Code's local tool and session state — not site content, and it
# changes often enough to be noise in every diff. Kept on disk, out of
# the repo. Note this takes .claude/launch.json with it: that's the dev
# server config for the preview tool, and it is recreated locally rather
# than shared.
.claude/
.impeccable/
